      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `55e5abafc9f6dbc451d8610ee00910937a7910106efdbb8a3107a6a061bc77cb--45130do005_200809.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008-09\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | fa2784334908f4ebdb092f55afd39fd4cce108b5dd1cb2fc57a73fbb028ffb05 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | fe3d6b7a6013d08cd207bee0b213ab57391a471014574e1c5bec84a871d5f882 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | d570172a1cb5eabef67e3606d81ead7b7c14b343b5a0c6f6c74e5587ca7b5207 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 6cadc73b7fca0c9d862a464bdbd5c2445d281868421fc54b21aa1f394de59f49 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | c8cb2e0088fedb8fb250db7621de036783a0071d5409e014fbd10f2e666a9cdf | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 1dccfaf7c7717c430c8d909047acb49ff8ee4c2de831d485976ee0a7890d0a59 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | a4ac760e15de012d5830b626ec38472e95c55e46fc2d73770479587ade9d9fd6 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 0b3b0b1c80c864fbf991d56521361ca322bb0e74ecd8eaa86eb4063e19d5a6d3 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | c501d26564fc33b63944d29df5f05d12d5dabd3c1914bcf8599d20e0ec4b5eda | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 01eb7bfce992b618198656059bd60ea403fd61a0e7986bc439da7499c37937dc | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 330f9dd700f949c8e300933f935c1555b5f6169a5b0c8146d2de347a2f5af242 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 9a3e4e3e7b054b483ebd150086016cf5b9956f7ec6cf622556b72cf16ce1cb5d | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 459e99877d9e7c541e07ce10c433f808d01aa6261461ab18b2bd423790a9335e | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 28a7e89b74b9265c89b2274d7a654d9eaac5b050407bc50397195ae3c78b7fb4 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | f65b2ab427a06f6a6c7acc5de3cbd7e1f26d6b75a1acf4e2a8b74a9dfcca8aa0 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and che